sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as YubiKey
    participant B as Browser
    participant G as Gateway worker
    participant M as MySQL

    B->>G: Start registration with username and account password
    G->>M: Open connection and authenticate password factor 1
    activate M
    M-->>G: WebAuthn factor 2 pending - registration sandbox
    Note over G,M: Keep this same connection open through INITIATE and FINISH
    G->>M: INITIATE REGISTRATION
    M-->>G: Challenge, RP/account data and client plugin name
    G-->>B: WebAuthn create options through the owner-bound flow
    B->>K: Create credential - local PIN/verification and touch
    K-->>B: Credential and attestation
    Note over K,B: PIN and private key are not posted to the gateway
    B->>G: Serialized credential and one-use request_id
    G->>G: Check origin, challenge, RP hash, presence and verification
    G->>M: FINISH REGISTRATION with encoded attestation
    M-->>G: OK or registration rejection
    G->>M: Close registration connection
    deactivate M
    G-->>B: Final success or error event
    Note over B,G: Success is reported only after MySQL accepts FINISH
